      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُمَيْصَآءُ</span></b>  [dim. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَمْصَآءُ</span>, fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْمَصُ</span>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشِّعْرَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرُّمَيْصَآءُ</span> [<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشِّعْرَى الغُمَيْصَآءُ</span>, i. e., <i>Procyon;</i>
